# "Whenever you tap an untapped creature an opponent controls" (CR 603.2, 701.26a) names a creature: Bot1's Icy Manipulator tapping
# Bot2's untapped Mox Emerald, an artifact that is no creature, is a tap by Bot1 (it is in Bot1.Taps) but no trigger of Solitary
# Sanctuary, so Devoted Hero gets no +1/+1 counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Devoted Hero
Black Lotus
Icy Manipulator
Solitary Sanctuary
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Island x20

